  "message": "I'm sorry, but I can't remove a passenger from a reservation. The number of passengers on a reservation cannot be changed — this applies to all agents, including human agents. What I can do is update an existing passenger's details (for example, correcting a name or date of birth) for the same number of passengers. Would you like help with that instead?"
}

